roff="50">20&#x000b1;1.9</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.1&#x000b1;0.04</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">20&#x000b1;2.1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x000b1;0.3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">35&#x000b1;4.3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.1&#x000b1;0.02</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">35&#x000b1;3.7</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Docetaxel</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.001&#x000b1;0.0005</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">15&#x000b1;1.8</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5&#x000b1;0.9</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">25&#x000b1;2.8</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5&#x000b1;1.0</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">30&#x000b1;4.1</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.01&#x000b1;0.006</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">60&#x000b1;5.5</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Gemcitabine</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.5&#x000b1;0.04</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02014;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x000b1;0.4</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003e;100</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.1&#x000b1;0.03</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">30&#x000b1;4.0</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.5&#x000b1;0.07</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">17&#x000b1;2.3</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Vinorelbine</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5&#x000b1;1.3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">100&#x000b1;10.2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5&#x000b1;0.7</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">90&#x000b1;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2&#x000b1;0.3</td><td align="center" valign="top" char